# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# A global ignore pattern (`Icon?`) matches this directory case-insensitively on
# macOS, so the app icons were silently never committed — and `generate_context!`
# reads them at compile time, so the crate would not build anywhere else.
!icons/
!icons/**
